92186414817 1075 #edb/ref 17592186414793 13194139534226 17592186045417 true] [17592186414817 1075 #edb/ref 17592186414795 13194139534226 17592186045417 true] [17592186414817 1075 #edb/ref 17592186414800 13194139534226 17592186045417 true] [17592186414817 1075 #edb/ref 17592186414807 13194139534226 17592186045417 true] [17592186414817 1075 #edb/ref 17592186414811 13194139534226 17592186045417 true] [17592186414817 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139534226 17592186045417 true] [17592186414817 1077 "selection" 13194139534226 17592186045417 true] [17592186414817 1078 #edb/ref 17592186414800 13194139534226 17592186045417 true] [17592186414817 1079 #uuid "e5da8752-1f0d-59e0-a94c-e374bf67e5d8" 13194139534226 17592186045417 true] [17592186414818 1068 #edb/ref 17592186414815 13194139534226 17592186045417 true] [17592186414818 1069 "q-183569" 13194139534226 17592186045417 true] [17592186414818 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045486 13194139534226 17592186045417 true] [17592186414818 1071 "There is a real number such that, added to any natural number, gives a positive number.\n\nExpress the above in formal language." 13194139534226 17592186045417 true] [17592186414818 1072 #uuid "61ea11f5-e114-5b4e-93aa-fef7b636de63" 13194139534226 17592186045417 true] [17592186414818 1074 "Notice that our sentence can be re-phrased as \n\nThere exists a real number $x$ such that, added to any natural number, gives a positive number.\n\nNow, \"$x$ added to any natural number gives a positive number\" means that\n\nFor any natural number $n,$ we have that $x+n>0.$\n\nTherefore, we get the following statement:\n\nThere exists a real number $x$ such that for any natural number $n$ we have that $x+n>0.$\n\nMore formally, this reads as\n\n$∃\\,x\\in R,\\,∀\\,n\\in N,\\,x+n>0.$" 13194139534226 17592186045417 true] [17592186414819 1068 #edb/ref 17592186414813 13194139534226 17592186045417 true] [17592186414819 1069 "q-183717" 13194139534226 17592186045417 true] [17592186414819 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 13194139534226 17592186045417 true] [17592186414819 1071 "There is a real number such that, raised to any integer, the result is a rational number.\n\nExpress the statement above in formal language." 13194139534226 17592186045417 true] [17592186414819 1072 #uuid "822441e0-0d3a-577b-9cb1-929e6c39db8d" 13194139534226 17592186045417 true] [17592186414819 1074 "Let's examine our statement:\n\n- The words \"there exists\" indicate that we use an existential quantifier, $∃.$\n\n- The word \"any\" indicates that we use a universal quantifier, $∀.$\n\n- The sentence refers to real numbers and integers. So, by denoting our numbers as $x$ and $k,$ respectively, we have\n\n$$\n∃\\,x\\in R,\\,∀\\,k\\in Z.\n$$\n\n- Finally, the condition in the statement can be written as follows:\n\n$$\n{x}^{k}\\in Q\n$$\n\nTherefore, we write the statement as follows:\n\n$∃\\,x\\in R,\\,∀\\,k\\in Z,\\,{x}^{k}\\in Q$" 13194139534226 17592186045417 true] [17592186414820 1068 #edb/ref 17592186414817 13194139534226 17592186045417 true] [17592186414820 1069 "q-183556" 13194139534226 17592186045417 true] [17592186414820 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 13194139534226 17592186045417 true] [17592186414820 1071 "$512$ is a power of base $2.$\n\nExpress the statement above in formal language." 13194139534226 17592186045417 true] [17592186414820 1072 #uuid "8f1922dc-ffa7-525a-929e-f25f8887b492" 13194139534226 17592186045417 true] [17592186414820 1074 "Recall that \"$512$ is a power of base $2$\" means the following:\n\nThere exists an integer $k$ such that ${2}^{k}=512.$\n\nMore formally, this reads as follows:\n\n$∃\\,k\\in Z,\\,{2}^{k}=512$" 13194139534226 17592186045417 true] [17592186414821 1068 #edb/ref 17592186414816 13194139534226 17592186045417 true] [17592186414821 1069 "q-183715" 13194139534226 17592186045417 true] [17592186414821 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 13194139534226 17592186045417 true] [17592186414821 1071 "There exists an integer number such that, for any rational number, the product of both numbers is the second number.\n\nExpress the statement above in formal language." 13194139534226 17592186045417 true] [17592186414821 1072 #uuid "f4dd7341-6f18-5e73-afaa-e4cf5a0832e8" 13194139534226 17592186045417 true] [17592186414821 1074 "Let's examine our statement:\n\n- The words \"there exists\" indicate that we use an existential quantifier, $∃.$\n\n- The word \"any\" indicates that we use a universal quantifier, $∀.$\n\n- The sentence refers to integers and rational numbers. So, by denoting our numbers as $k$ and $q,$ respectively, we have\n\n$$\n∃\\,k\\in Z,\\,∀\\,q\\in Q.\n$$\n\n- Finally, the condition in the statement can be written as follows:\n\n$$\nkq=q\n$$\n\nTherefore, we write the statement as follows:\n\n$∃\\,k\\in Z,\\,∀\\,q\\in Q,\\,kq=q$" 13194139534226 17592186045417 true] [17592186414822 1058 #edb/ref 17592186414824 13194139534226 17592186045417 true] [17592186414822 1062 #uuid "5cc4daae-92a4-562a-b0bc-69db33a25a95" 13194139534226 17592186045417 true] [17592186414822 1063 #edb/ref 17592186157626 13194139534226 17592186045417 true] [17592186414823 1058 #edb/ref 17592186414825 13194139534226 17592186045417 true] [17592186414823 1062 #uuid "684e8d56-c781-5037-9fa3-b779df0822ad" 13194139534226 17592186045417 true] [17592186414823 1063 #edb/ref 17592186414818 13194139534226 17592186045417 true] [17592186414824 1058 #edb/ref 17592186414823 13194139534226 17592186045417 true] [17592186414824 1062 #uuid "7d4c67a0-d61f-5e10-ac71-f09f134d7a7a" 13194139534226 17592186045417 true] [17592186414824 1063 #edb/ref 17592186414820 13194139534226 17592186045417 true] [17592186414825 1058 #edb/ref 17592186414826 13194139534226 17592186045417 true] [17592186414825 1062 #uuid "d0fd9634-715c-5f74-8009-1d3e9fd3b761" 13194139534226 17592186045417 true] [17592186414825 1063 #edb/ref 17592186414821 13194139534226 17592186045417 true] [17592186414826 1062 #uuid "dfab1f2b-4555-5bd9-9f40-20d004a7cae8" 13194139534226 17592186045417 true] [17592186414826 1063 #edb/ref 175